test.yaml:12:15: this step downloads every artifact of the run that triggered the workflow, which ran the code of a pull request, not only the one it expects. the environment "staging" of job "staging" has no required reviewers, so no one has to approve the run. name it with "name:" (or select a few with "pattern:") so that nothing else of what the pull request uploaded reaches the workspace [untrusted-artifact]
